---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Racchi Ayllu — Huayllabamba — Urubamba — Cusco" description="Primer registro público de la fiesta de Racchi Ayllu, comunidad campesina.">
  
  <div class="scroll-wrapper fixed top-0 left-0 w-full min-h-screen will-change-transform z-0">
    
    <!-- CINEMATIC HERO SECTION -->
    <section class="relative w-full h-[120vh] overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center bg-[#1B4F8C]" id="hero-cinematic">
      <!-- Background Sky -->
      <img src="https://raft-blast-61784561.figma.site/_assets/v11/16b5007d9c93971e26ffe4e0e3e37946f6bd538c.png" class="hero-layer layer-sky absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full object-cover" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'" />
      
      <!-- Back Mountains / Glow -->
      <img src="https://raft-blast-61784561.figma.site/_assets/v11/8a7f8af50e0ce92ec2e228e7b0b4112178c51cf1.png" class="hero-layer layer-back absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full object-cover" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'" />

      <!-- Title (Behind Front Layers) -->
      <div class="relative z-10 text-center hero-title-wrapper pointer-events-none mt-[-15vh]">
        <h1 class="text-[5rem] md:text-[10rem] font-bold text-white tracking-widest font-display leading-[1.1] drop-shadow-[0_10px_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)] uppercase">Racchi<br/>Ayllu</h1>
      </div>

      <!-- Midground -->
      <img src="https://raft-blast-61784561.figma.site/_assets/v11/864afe00e41e2fa20a5aa546e15cb807e0f81384.png" class="hero-layer layer-mid absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full object-cover z-20 pointer-events-none" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'" />

      <!-- Left Split -->
      <img src="https://raft-blast-61784561.figma.site/_assets/v11/7bd7e30dce4dc744b8b60f152b1156fcbc171d99.png" class="hero-layer layer-left absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full object-cover z-30 pointer-events-none origin-bottom-left" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'" />
      
      <!-- Right Split -->
      <img src="https://raft-blast-61784561.figma.site/_assets/v11/673dbb11f38e6530664d603a1157143973c9ff48.png" class="hero-layer layer-right absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full object-cover z-30 pointer-events-none origin-bottom-right" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'" />
      
      <!-- Foreground -->
      <img src="https://raft-blast-61784561.figma.site/_assets/v11/1ce8424fa7de09e20037a54a938c4bb1a8f93e2b.png" class="hero-layer layer-fore absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full object-cover z-40 pointer-events-none" alt="" onerror="this.style.display='none'" />
    </section>

    <!-- MAIN CONTENT BELOW HERO -->
    <section class="relative z-40 bg-white pt-24 pb-16 border-t border-[#8B6F47]/20 shadow-2xl">
      <div class="max-w-[68ch] mx-auto px-6 text-center">
        <span class="mono-font text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-[#D4547E] font-bold">Comunidad Campesina</span>
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-display text-[#1B4F8C] mb-8 mt-4">Patrimonio Vivo del Valle Sagrado</h2>
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-[#2E2018] leading-relaxed">Racchi Ayllu es una comunidad campesina del distrito de Huayllabamba, provincia de Urubamba. En su jurisdicción, la cultura viva persiste a través del tiempo.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- QUICK FACTS SECTION -->
    <section class="relative z-40 bg-white py-12">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 md:gap-8">
          <div class="text-center p-6 border border-[#1B4F8C]/20 rounded-xl bg-white shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
            <span class="text-4xl block mb-4">⛰️</span>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-[#1B4F8C] mb-2 font-display">Altitud</h4>
            <p class="text-[#2E2018] mono-font font-bold">~3,652 m.s.n.m.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-6 border border-[#1B4F8C]/20 rounded-xl bg-white shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
            <span class="text-4xl block mb-4">👥</span>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-[#1B4F8C] mb-2 font-display">Población</h4>
            <p class="text-[#2E2018] mono-font font-bold">[Pendiente]</p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-6 border border-[#1B4F8C]/20 rounded-xl bg-white shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
            <span class="text-4xl block mb-4">📅</span>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-[#1B4F8C] mb-2 font-display">Reconocimiento</h4>
            <p class="text-[#2E2018] mono-font font-bold">[Pendiente]</p>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center p-6 border border-[#1B4F8C]/20 rounded-xl bg-white shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
            <span class="text-4xl block mb-4">📍</span>
            <h4 class="font-bold text-[#1B4F8C] mb-2 font-display">Ubicación</h4>
            <p class="text-[#2E2018] mono-font font-bold">Huayllabamba</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SOBRE LA COMUNIDAD -->
    <section class="relative z-40 bg-white py-24 border-t border-[#8B6F47]/10">
      <div class="max-w-[68ch] mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
          <span class="mono-font text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-[#D4547E] font-bold">Nuestra Historia</span>
          <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display text-[#1B4F8C] mb-8 mt-4">Corazón de los Andes</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="text-[#2E2018] text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed space-y-6">
          <p>
            Racchi Ayllu es mucho más que un territorio; es una herencia cultural viva. Ubicada en la parte alta del Valle Sagrado, nuestra comunidad ha mantenido sus tradiciones desde tiempos inmemoriales, sosteniendo una economía basada en la agricultura y la ganadería.
          </p>
          <p>
            Hoy en día, somos un punto emergente e importante para el <strong>turismo vivencial</strong>. Aquí, compartimos nuestra textilería andina ancestral y el cuidado de nuestras alpacas y llamas, abriendo nuestras puertas para que el mundo experimente el verdadero respeto por la Pachamama.
          </p>
          <div class="bg-[#E8DCC4]/30 p-6 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-[#E8792B] mt-8 text-base">
            <strong>Aclaración Importante:</strong> Suele confundirse nuestra comunidad con el sitio arqueológico de Raqchi (Templo de Wiracocha) ubicado en Canchis. Racchi Ayllu es un asentamiento completamente distinto en Urubamba.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FESTIVIDADES Y CULTURA -->
    <section class="relative z-40 bg-white py-24 border-t border-[#8B6F47]/10">
      <div class="max-w-[68ch] mx-auto px-6 mb-16 text-center">
        <span class="mono-font text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-[#E8792B] font-bold">Expresiones Culturales</span>
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display text-[#1B4F8C] mb-8 mt-4">Nuestras Festividades</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-16">
          <a href="/es/festividades/virgen-asunta" class="block p-10 border border-[#1B4F8C]/20 bg-white/40 hover:bg-[#1B4F8C] hover:text-[#E8DCC4] transition-all rounded-lg group shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1">
            <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4 font-display">La Virgen Asunta</h3>
            <p class="opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-lg">Una festividad única del 21 al 25 de agosto, a diferencia del resto del Valle Sagrado.</p>
            <div class="mt-6 font-bold mono-font text-sm uppercase flex items-center gap-2 group-hover:text-[#E8792B]">
              Explorar <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">→</span>
            </div>
          </a>
          <a href="/es/festividades/virgen-asunta/comparsas/qapaq-chunchu" class="block p-10 border border-[#E8792B]/20 bg-white/40 hover:bg-[#E8792B] hover:text-white transition-all rounded-lg group shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1">
            <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4 font-display">Qapaq Chunchu</h3>
            <p class="opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-lg">Danza de los guerreros amazónicos. Evolución contemporánea del antiguo Iriji Chunchu.</p>
            <div class="mt-6 font-bold mono-font text-sm uppercase flex items-center gap-2 group-hover:text-[#2E2018]">
              Leer Ficha <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">→</span>
            </div>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- MAPA -->
    <section class="relative z-40 bg-white py-24 border-t border-[#8B6F47]/10">
      <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="text-center mb-16">
          <span class="mono-font text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-[#D4547E] font-bold">Encuéntranos</span>
          <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display text-[#1B4F8C] mt-4">Nuestra Ubicación</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full h-[500px] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-[#1B4F8C]/20 bg-[#E8DCC4] flex items-center justify-center">
          <iframe 
            src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m18!1m12!1m3!1d31065.74797089758!2d-72.0838321!3d-13.3366034!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!3m3!1m2!1s0x916dd54f2c8d2345%3A0xc02e4d0d4cd5bc1!2sHuayllabamba!5e0!3m2!1ses-419!2spe!4v1700000000000!5m2!1ses-419!2spe" 
            width="100%" 
            height="100%" 
            style="border:0;" 
            allowfullscreen="" 
            loading="lazy" 
            referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade">
          </iframe>
        </div>
        <p class="text-center mt-6 text-[#8B6F47] mono-font text-sm font-bold">[El mapa apunta a Huayllabamba. Por favor, enviar enlace exacto de Racchi Ayllu]</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  :root {
    --scroll-progress: 0;
  }
  
  .layer-sky {
    transform: scale(calc(1 + var(--scroll-progress) * 0.1)) translateY(calc(var(--scroll-progress) * 15%));
  }
  .layer-back {
    transform: scale(calc(1 + var(--scroll-progress) * 0.15)) translateY(calc(var(--scroll-progress) * 10%));
  }
  .hero-title-wrapper {
    transform: translateY(calc(var(--scroll-progress) * 50%));
    opacity: calc(1 - var(--scroll-progress) * 2);
  }
  .layer-mid {
    transform: scale(calc(1 + var(--scroll-progress) * 0.3));
  }
  .layer-left {
    transform: translateX(calc(var(--scroll-progress) * -20%)) scale(calc(1 + var(--scroll-progress) * 0.4));
  }
  .layer-right {
    transform: translateX(calc(var(--scroll-progress) * 20%)) scale(calc(1 + var(--scroll-progress) * 0.4));
  }
  .layer-fore {
    transform: translateY(calc(var(--scroll-progress) * -10%)) scale(calc(1 + var(--scroll-progress) * 0.1));
  }
</style>

<script>
  import { initMotion } from '../../scripts/motion.js';
  // Initialize only on client
  if (typeof window !== 'undefined') {
    initMotion();
  }
</script>
